{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1113; --card:#111418; --muted:#9aa4a4; --accent:#a88cff; --accent-2:#6fe7c1; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      --radius:14px; --maxW:1100px; --gutter:20px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(168,140,255,0.06), transparent), radial-gradient(900px 500px at 90% 90%, rgba(111,231,193,0.03), transparent),var(--bg); color:#e6eef0; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxW);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#081017;font-box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(12,12,14,0.6)}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 8px;font-size:15px}
    nav a.active{color:#fff}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px;margin-top:28px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,8,0.6);}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.3px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .method{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .moods{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
    .mood-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .mood-btn.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(168,140,255,0.14), rgba(111,231,193,0.06));border-color:transparent;color:#fff}
    .method-output{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px}
    .btn{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;color:#041018;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}

    /* Aroma wheel */
    .wheel-wrap{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .wheel{width:320px;height:320px}
    .note-list{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:6px}
    .note{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Contact form */
    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);color:#eaf6f3}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:6px}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    .faq{margin-top:18px;display:grid;gap:10px}
    .faq-item{background:transparent;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}

    @media (max-width:960px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:18px}}    
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">A</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Begin</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html">Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="active">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="grid">
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="connect-heading">
        <h1 id="connect-heading">Let's design a small, safe scent practice</h1>
        <p class="lead">Reach out for a consult, ask about blends, or try our interactive mood selector below. All suggestions are safety-forward and may support your wellbeing; they are not medical advice.</p>

        <div class="method">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:600">Mood-to-Method</div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Choose what you feel now and the page will suggest a gentle approach.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pill" id="method-badge">For curious breath</div>
          </div>

          <div class="moods" id="mood-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood selector">
            <button class="mood-btn" data-method="grounding" data-cta="Arrange a grounding consult">Tense / Wired</button>
            <button class="mood-btn" data-method="clarity" data-cta="Request a focus guide">Foggy / Distracted</button>
            <button class="mood-btn" data-method="rest" data-cta="Ask about rest blends">Restless / Sleepless</button>
            <button class="mood-btn" data-method="lift" data-cta="Explore uplifting options">Low / Heavy</button>
            <button class="mood-btn" data-method="refresh" data-cta="Try a short refresh" >Overwhelm</button>
            <button class="mood-btn" data-method="ritual" data-cta="Book a ritual design">Preparing for an event</button>
          </div>

          <div class="method-output">
            <div id="method-title" style="font-weight:700">A mindful inhalation ritual</div>
            <div id="method-desc" style="color:var(--muted)">A simple three-breath practice using a focused inhale and a soft exhale. May support settling and clearer attention when used safely and thoughtfully.</div>
            <div class="cta-row">
              <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" id="primary-cta" class="btn">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
              <button class="btn ghost" id="secondary-cta">Email: {{EMAIL}}</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr style="opacity:0.04;margin:18px 0">

        <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-direction:column">
          <form id="contact-form">
            <div class="row" style="flex-direction:column">
              <label for="name">Name</label>
              <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
            </div>
            <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="email">Email</label>
                <input id="email" name="email" placeholder="{{EMAIL}}" required>
              </div>
              <div style="width:200px">
                <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                <input id="phone" name="phone" placeholder="{{PHONE}}">
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="interest">I'm interested in</label>
              <select id="interest" name="interest">
                <option>Personal consult</option>
                <option>Custom blend</option>
                <option>Micro-habit plan</option>
                <option>Group event</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <label for="message">Message</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you'd like (keep safety notes if you have pets, pregnancy, or sensitivities)"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
              <button type="submit" class="btn">Send message</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="phone-link">Call: {{PHONE}}</button>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div class="faq">
            <div class="faq-item">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Safety & dilution</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">All blend suggestions include recommended dilution ranges and a patch test. If you are pregnant, nursing, or have pets, mention that in your message — we’ll tailor options that emphasize low-volatility, skin-safe choices.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Pets & pregnancy</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Some essential oils may be irritating to animals or contraindicated in pregnancy. We prioritize safety: always consult your care provider for personal medical questions and disclose pets/pregnancy in consults.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-item">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Patch test</div>
              <div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Before using any topical blend, dilute as directed and perform a 24-hour patch test on a small area of skin. If irritation occurs, discontinue use.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
          <div>Prefer a direct note? Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent-2)">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent-2)">{{PHONE}}</a>.</div>
        </footer>
      </section>

      <aside class="card">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">Aroma wheel — notes & ideas</div>
            <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:6px">Hover or tap notes to see safe uses and simple rituals; categories are top, middle, base notes.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Interactive</div>
        </div>

        <div class="wheel-wrap" style="margin-top:14px">
          <!-- Unique SVG wheel built inline -->
          <svg class="wheel" viewBox="0 0 320 320" role="img" aria-label="Aroma wheel">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#a88cff" stop-opacity="0.9"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#6fe7c1" stop-opacity="0.9"/></linearGradient>
              <filter id="glow"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6" result="b"/><feMerge><feMergeNode in="b"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge></filter>
            </defs>
            <circle cx="160" cy="160" r="140" fill="#071015" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.03)"/>

            <!-- Top notes sector -->
            <path d="M160 160 L160 20 A140 140 0 0 1 282 71 Z" fill="url(#g1)" opacity="0.12" data-type="top" class="sector" />
            <!-- Middle notes sector -->
            <path d="M160 160 L282 71 A140 140 0 0 1 200 280 Z" fill="#6fe7c1" opacity="0.08" data-type="middle" class="sector" />
            <!-- Base notes sector -->
            <path d="M160 160 L200 280 A140 140 0 0 1 20 160 Z" fill="#a88cff" opacity="0.07" data-type="base" class="sector" />
            <!-- Connector to top left -->
            <path d="M160 160 L20 160 A140 140 0 0 1 160 20 Z" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.02" />

            <!-- small circles for representative notes -->
            <g class="notes">
              <circle cx="230" cy="80" r="10" fill="#fff" opacity="0.9" data-note="bergamot" data-category="top" />
              <circle cx="260" cy="150" r="10" fill="#fff" opacity="0.9" data-note="lavender" data-category="middle" />
              <circle cx="170" cy="260" r="10" fill="#fff" opacity="0.9" data-note="cedarwood" data-category="base" />
              <circle cx="110" cy="230" r="10" fill="#fff" opacity="0.9" data-note="vetiver" data-category="base" />
              <circle cx="90" cy="120" r="10" fill="#fff" opacity="0.9" data-note="geranium" data-category="middle" />
              <circle cx="200" cy="40" r="10" fill="#fff" opacity="0.9" data-note="lemon" data-category="top" />
            </g>

            <text x="160" y="160" text-anchor="middle" dy="6" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700">Aroma Wheel</text>
          </svg>

          <div class="note-list" id="note-info">
            <div class="note" id="note-top">Top: bright, ephemeral</div>
            <div class="note" id="note-middle">Middle: body, character</div>
            <div class="note" id="note-base">Base: grounding, longevity</div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Tap or hover a dot to see a safe use and a micro-ritual suggestion.</div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;width:100%">
            <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px" id="note-detail">Hover a note to get a short guide.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
              <button class="btn ghost" id="view-blends">See blends</button>
              <button class="btn" id="try-ritual">Try micro-ritual</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr style="opacity:0.04;margin:16px 0">
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">A short safety reminder: Always dilute essential oils; for skin use, follow recommended carrier oil ratios and perform a patch test. If you have allergies, pets, or are pregnant, disclose this in your consult.</div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
      <!-- Decorative pattern (embedded so no external assets required) -->
      <defs>
        <pattern id="p1" width="16" height="16" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <rect width="16" height="16" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.01)"/>
          <path d="M0 8 L8 0 M8 16 L16 8" stroke="rgba(168,140,255,0.02)" stroke-width="1"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method: wire up buttons to change method and CTA
    (function(){
      const moodBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.mood-btn');
      const title = document.getElementById('method-title');
      const desc = document.getElementById('method-desc');
      const badge = document.getElementById('method-badge');
      const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primary-cta');
      const defaultLabel = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
      const defaultUrl = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';

      const methods = {
        grounding:{title:'Grounding breath sequence',badge:'For steadying',desc:'Three slow diaphragmatic breaths paired with a grounded scent. Use low-volatility base notes diluted to skin-safe ratios; may support calm focus.'},
        clarity:{title:'Focused inhaler routine',badge:'For clearer attention',desc:'A short inhaler method using bright top and clear middle notes. Keep single-note inhalations short and well-diluted; may support transient alertness.'},
        rest:{title:'Bedside night roll-on',badge:'For settling into rest',desc:'A gentle roll-on blend emphasizing low-evaporating base oils and soothing middle notes. Apply to pulse points after a patch test; may support comfort before sleep.'},
        lift:{title:'Uplift mist practice',badge:'For a soft lift',desc:'A room spritz with carefully chosen top/middle notes; mist briefly and ventilate the space. Avoid prolonged exposure for pets; may support a lighter mood.'},
        refresh:{title:'Micro-refresh inhalation',badge:'For reorienting',desc:'A brief scent-on-tissue practice: two quick inhales followed by grounding exhale. Use bright, safe top notes diluted if topical; may support short-term clarity.'},
        ritual:{title:'Event-ready scent ritual',badge:'For intentional presence',desc:'A pre-event ritual combining a tiny inhale, a centering affirmation, and a carry-along inhaler. Designed conservatively with safety-first dilutions.'}
      };

      function setActive(btn){
        moodBtns.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
      }

      moodBtns.forEach(btn=>{
        btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
          setActive(btn);
          const key = btn.dataset.method;
          const ctaText = btn.dataset.cta || defaultLabel;
          const data = methods[key] || {};
          title.textContent = data.title || 'A mindful inhalation ritual';
          desc.textContent = data.desc || 'A simple practice that may support small shifts in attention.';
          badge.textContent = data.badge || 'For curious breath';
          primaryCta.textContent = ctaText;
          primaryCta.href = defaultUrl + (key? ('?mood='+encodeURIComponent(key)) : '');
        });
      });

      // Secondary CTA opens mail client
      document.getElementById('secondary-cta').addEventListener('click',function(){
        window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=Inquiry%20from%20contact%20page';
      });

      document.getElementById('phone-link').addEventListener('click',function(){ window.location.href='tel:{{PHONE}}'; });

      // Form submission — simple local handler (no backend)
      document.getElementById('contact-form').addEventListener('submit',function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const name = document.getElementById('name').value || 'friend';
        alert('Thank you, '+name+'. Your message has been noted. We will reply via email.');
        e.target.reset();
      });
    })();

    // Aroma wheel interactions
    (function(){
      const wheel = document.querySelector('.wheel');
      const noteDetail = document.getElementById('note-detail');
      const noteTop = document.getElementById('note-top');
      const noteMiddle = document.getElementById('note-middle');
      const noteBase = document.getElementById('note-base');

      const noteData = {
        bergamot:{title:'Bergamot — top note',use:'Citrus top note often used for brightening inhalation. Keep brief; may support a cheerful moment. Dilute for skin and avoid direct pet exposure.'},
        lemon:{title:'Lemon — top note',use:'Crisp citrus: refreshing in short inhalations. Best used in small quantities and well-ventilated spaces.'},
        lavender:{title:'Lavender — middle note',use:'Calming middle note often used in blends for winding down. Use diluted for topical application and perform a patch test.'},
        geranium:{title:'Geranium — middle note',use:'Floral middle note that pairs well with baser woods. May support balanced mood; dilute for skin use.'},
        cedarwood:{title:'Cedarwood — base note',use:'Woody base note with grounding character. Often used sparingly; suitable for diffuser blends in ventilated rooms.'},
        vetiver:{title:'Vetiver — base note',use:'Deep, anchoring base note. Small amounts go far; generally recommended at low dilutions for topical blends.'}
      };

      function show(noteKey){
        const data = noteData[noteKey];
        if(!data) return;
        noteDetail.innerHTML = '<strong>'+data.title+'</strong><div style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">'+data.use+'</div>';
        // highlight category pill
        if(data.title.includes('top')){ noteTop.style.color='white'; noteMiddle.style.color='var(--muted)'; noteBase.style.color='var(--muted)'; }
        else if(data.title.includes('middle')){ noteMiddle.style.color='white'; noteTop.style.color='var(--muted)'; noteBase.style.color='var(--muted)'; }
        else { noteBase.style.color='white'; noteTop.style.color='var(--muted)'; noteMiddle.style.color='var(--muted)'; }
      }

      // attach listeners to note dots
      document.querySelectorAll('.notes circle').forEach(c=>{
        c.style.cursor='pointer';
        c.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>show(c.dataset.note));
        c.addEventListener('click',()=>show(c.dataset.note));
        c.addEventListener('touchstart',()=>show(c.dataset.note));
      });

      // small helpers for external buttons
      document.getElementById('view-blends').addEventListener('click',function(){ window.location.href='blends.html'; });
      document.getElementById('try-ritual').addEventListener('click',function(){ document.querySelector('.mood-btn[data-method="ritual"]').click(); window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'}); });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and quick guide for local testing\n\nFiles included in this bundle:\n- contact.html  — Fully self-contained contact page for the aromatherapy site.\n- README.md     — This file.\n\nPurpose\nThe contact page is built to be standalone and demonstrate interactive features that enhance consultation flow: a Mood-to-Method selector and an interactive Aroma Wheel. It uses only local HTML/CSS/JS and requires no backend to explore behaviors.\n\nPlaceholders to replace before publishing\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\n- {{TAGLINE}} (optional on other pages)\n- {{PHONE}}\n- {{EMAIL}}\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\n- {{CITY}}\n- {{STATE}}\n\nInteractive features\n1) Mood-to-Method selector\   - Click any mood button to change the recommended method title, description, and the primary CTA label.\   - The primary CTA URL is appended with a query parameter that reflects the chosen mood (e.g. ?mood=rest).\   - Secondary CTA opens the default mail client to {{EMAIL}}.\n\n2) Aroma Wheel\   - Hover or tap the white dots on the wheel to see note-specific guidance in the detail box.\   - The detail encourages safety-first language (dilution, patch tests, pets/pregnancy reminders).\n\nSafety & Copy notes\- All language on the page avoids medical claims and uses cautious phrasing like "may support".\- FAQ area includes dilution, patch test, pets, and pregnancy items to align with aromatherapy safety guidance.\n\nHow to test locally\1) Save the files to a folder.\n2) Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome/Firefox/Safari).\n3) Click moods to see the method text and CTA update.\n4) Hover/tap dots on the wheel to change the note detail.\n5) Submit the contact form to see a local alert (the form is intentionally frontend-only).\n\nNotes for developers\- No external fonts, images, or CDNs are used — the page includes an embedded SVG pattern for decorative purposes.\- If you integrate this into a larger site, ensure nav labels match your other pages. The nav set here intentionally differs: Begin, Offerings, Blends, Boutique, Rates, Story, Book, Connect.\- Replace placeholders server-side or via a simple templating step prior to deployment.\n\nAccessibility\- The wheel has role="img" and aria-label. Mood buttons are grouped with role="tablist". For production, expand ARIA labeling and keyboard interactions as needed.\n\nLicense & attribution\- This page was generated for a bespoke aromatherapy practitioner layout; reuse and adapt freely but keep safety language intact when offering blending or topical suggestions."}
BUNDLE_END
